{{~##
 What every generated source file starts with: the banner and its includes.

 Its own header first, which is what makes the header prove it compiles on its own rather
 than only after whatever a source file happened to include before it. A blank entry in
 `includes` is the gap between that and the standard library ones.
##~}}
